# Consolidated 2026-08-20: this block was duplicated verbatim earlier in
# this file (harmless -- gitignore patterns are idempotent -- but confusing
# to maintain in two places). Single copy kept here, extended with Week 4's
# 5 new analysis CSVs (scripts/analyze_week4_results.py), which were
# silently gitignored by this same allowlist until caught during Week 4
# closeout review.
/results/*
!/results/master_results.csv
!/results/master_results_prefix_week3_evaluation_bug.csv
!/results/degradation_by_ambient.csv
!/results/rl_vs_baseline_bootstrap.csv
!/results/rl_train_seed_dispersion.csv
!/results/optimality_gap.csv
